---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="site-footer">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1560px] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-ink px-6 py-10 text-paper sm:px-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr] md:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[.68rem] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-mist">Available for considered collaborations</p>
        <h2 data-parallax="0.035" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,7.8rem)] font-extrabold leading-[.82] tracking-[-.095em]">Let’s build the useful things.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="md:justify-self-end md:text-right">
        <p class="max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">For opportunities, ideas, and work that needs a clear point of view, get in touch.</p>
        <a class="button button-light mt-5 border-paper/40 bg-transparent text-paper hover:bg-paper hover:text-ink" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/krizekster/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-t border-paper/20 pt-4 font-mono text-[.64rem] uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-mist sm:flex-row">
      <span>© {currentYear} Krize Kster</span>
      <span>Designed with clarity in mind</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
